{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Yf3viDGqRx1793329003.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>葵涌道昨晚（29日）發生私家車翻側意外。事發於晚上10時許，一輛私家車正沿葵涌道往青葵方向行駛，當行至港鐵荔景站對開時，疑失控撞向水馬，導致車身翻側橫亘路中，四輪朝天。</p><p><p><img alt=\"873068218_10163970517852252_2053985987479977168_n.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DeKI96XrOS1793328957.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>據網上流傳的車 Cam 片段顯示，該私家車撞擊水馬時，現場瞬間濺起龐大水花，私家車隨即失控翻側。幸意外中男司機未有受傷，事後自行爬出車廂並報案，無需送院治理。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-30-10h48m14s755.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ctzSPezFEi1793328975.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:02:23.892463+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:40:04.256153+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:28.935449+00:00","content_hash":"18720229713e2547a40ceac924e3645390f7094621a868877c320807465de5a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}